From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 04:26:06 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] msi: MsiOpenPackage("") creates an empty package

An empty path opens a package over a scratch database with no persistent
tables, no summary information and no _Streams/_Storages tables. Its
non-persistent _Property and #_FolderCache tables are listed in _Tables,
MsiDatabaseCommit succeeds, the scratch file goes away with the package.
Removes 30 todo_wine from msi package.c (test_emptypackage, test_msipackage).

diff --git a/dlls/msi/msipriv.h b/dlls/msi/msipriv.h
index 1149740..87bf22f 100644
--- a/dlls/msi/msipriv.h
+++ b/dlls/msi/msipriv.h
@@ -120,6 +120,7 @@ typedef struct tagMSIDATABASE
     MSISTREAM *streams;
     UINT num_streams;
     UINT num_streams_allocated;
+    BOOL empty;  /* the scratch database of an empty package */
 } MSIDATABASE;
 
 typedef struct tagMSIVIEW MSIVIEW;
